# Build context for both server images is the repo root (..), so this keeps
# the context lean while still shipping what the Dockerfiles actually COPY.
#
# servers/netrek-server and netrek_containerized/scripts are deliberately NOT
# excluded: the vanilla server image builds our own server sources over the
# upstream clone and compiles scripts/peek.c. Excluding them silently breaks
# that COPY.
**/.git
reference_repos
# the X11 client tree is built into the image; the SDL2 client is Mac-side
clients
!clients/netrek-client-cow
clients/netrek-client-cow/pixmaps-hr
netrek_containerized/scripts/botmon/node_modules
netrek_containerized/.github
netrek_containerized/.claude
netrek_containerized/README.md
netrek_containerized/LICENSE
*.tgz
.DS_Store
